VanishGeo
=========

VanishGeo is a derivative work based on VanishMe:

  https://github.com/XiNian-dada/VanishMe

The original work is licensed under the MIT License. Its copyright and license
text are preserved in LICENSE. This source attribution is not an installation,
repository setup, update, or release destination for VanishGeo.

VanishGeo uses a unified site configuration model, dynamic document-targeted
runtime injection, DNR Accept-Language rules, browser WebRTC policy control,
user-initiated exit-location detection and confirmation, extension-side
one-time diagnostic reports, observation fixtures, and regression tests.
Exit-location providers are contacted only for explicit detection or
redetection; there is no periodic background location refresh.

Current installation, permission, privacy, and release behavior is documented
in README.md, INSTALL.md, PERMISSIONS.md, PRIVACY.md, and RELEASE.md.
